# Aegis Sculptor: a graveyard of exactly two cards (Black Lotus and a Lightning Bolt) pays "exile two cards from your graveyard":
# Bot1 accepts at its upkeep, both go, and the creature has its counter (3/4). Bot2's own graveyard Bolt is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Aegis Sculptor
Lightning Bolt
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
